# Game captures pulled out of a frame analysis run, used to confirm the LOD hash
# and perceptual signature behaviour against real data. Not test inputs - the
# harness in imagehash_test.cpp generates its own images.
#
# Deliberately not committed: these are ~2.6MB of texture dumps extracted from a
# commercial game, plus ~4.5MB of frame analysis logs. Both are bulky and the
# textures are not ours to redistribute.
#
# Patterns are relative to this directory, not the repository root.
*.dds
*.dsc
*_log.txt
